   "fieldtype": "HTML",
   "options": "<div class='text-muted small'>Create, Read, and Update are allowed by default. Cancel, Delete, and Submit stay off until you enable them here. A connector can turn an action off, but it cannot turn Cancel, Delete, or Submit on unless this page allows it. Frappe permissions for the connector's user still apply on top of these switches.</div>"
  },
